  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy Service_A Mapping of Climate, Peace and Security in Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed fact sheet aims to enhance understanding of climate-related security risks in Myanmar through research, supporting peacebuilding, and evidence-based decision-making. The objectives are detailed as following:
&#x2022;	To generate high-quality, policy-relevant research on climate-related security risks in Myanmar, fostering awareness of the interconnectedness of climate, peace, and security.
&#x2022;	To identify and explore potential opportunities for peacebuilding and conflict mediation in the context of climate change in Myanmar.
&#x2022;	To inform evidence-based decision-making and programming by international and local actors on climate-related security risks in Myanmar.</narrative>
  </description>
